  "minutes": 8,
  "summary": "Tradeciety's 'dirty retest': on the 4-hour chart a mature trend turns into a distribution pattern (lower highs, divergence) that breaks out; price moves away, then falls back into the pattern without exceeding its extreme; on the 15-minute chart enter when the micro pattern breaks in the breakout's direction, stop above the higher-timeframe breakout level, target the next support/resistance on the left.",
